  "producingRevision": "NOT_ESTABLISHED",
  "producingRevisionReason": "No baseline artefact carries a core revision, a scorer revision or a timestamp — the JSON files' only top-level keys are totalPlantedMinor, knownCases, unknownCases, mustRefuseCases and candidates — and none was ever Git-tracked, so nothing in the repository states which build produced which measurement. The one exception is bounded: docs/BENCHMARK_REVISION_V2.md records one baseline's hash beside core c80b35c5…, which establishes WHICH MEASUREMENT those bytes are and not who produced them or when.",
