  "historicalReproducibilityReason": "The reconciliation core has moved four times since the earliest of these baselines (c80b35c5 -> 831b2dab -> ec1efe95 -> fdc6c785 -> 60e71f6f). A pre-correction baseline cannot be reproduced on this build: the execution would be blocked by the calculation-method compatibility gate before anything was computed. No reproduction was attempted and none is asserted.",
